                "method": "assign_ticket",
                "description": "Agent takes ownership of an unassigned ticket",
                "spec": "On the current SUPPORT360_TICKET row, verify STATUS is Open (a ticket already assigned cannot be Assigned again). Query SUPPORT360_AGENT for all rows where AGENT_STATUS = 'Active' and AGENT_AVAILABILITY = 'Available'; if none are found, fail with a clear error and make no changes. Otherwise randomly select ONE agent from that eligible set (its AGENT_ID). Update the SUPPORT360_TICKET row: set STATUS to 'Assigned' and ASSIGNED_AGENT to the randomly selected AGENT_ID (do not use any value the user entered \u2014 the Assigned Agent field is no longer user-editable). Append one entry to the ticket Activity/History Log (table to be confirmed once the Ticket Activity Log object is designed) with TICKET_NO = this ticket, ACTION_TYPE = 'Assigned', FIELD_CHANGED = 'ASSIGNED_AGENT', OLD_VALUE = '' (blank), NEW_VALUE = the randomly selected AGENT_ID, CHANGED_BY = current user, CHANGE_DATE = now. Return {\"updates\": {\"status\": \"Assigned\", \"assigned_agent\": <randomly selected AGENT_ID>}}."
              },
              "validations": [
                {
                  "type": "expression",
                  "name": "Must be Open",
                  "message": "Ticket {form.ticket_no} can only be assigned when STATUS is Open (current status: {form.status}).",
                  "expression": "{form.status} == \"Open\""
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Reassign",
              "handler": "item_change",
              "scope": "row",
              "business_logic": {
                "method": "reassign_ticket",
                "description": "Reassign an already-assigned ticket to a different Agent, keeping its STATUS unchanged",
                "spec": "On the current SUPPORT360_TICKET row, set ASSIGNED_AGENT to the value in REASSIGN_TO_AGENT. Do not change STATUS. Then clear REASSIGN_TO_AGENT. Append one entry to the ticket's Activity/History Log (table to be confirmed once the Ticket Activity Log object is designed) with TICKET_NO = this ticket, ACTION_TYPE = 'Reassigned', FIELD_CHANGED = 'ASSIGNED_AGENT', OLD_VALUE = the previous ASSIGNED_AGENT, NEW_VALUE = REASSIGN_TO_AGENT, CHANGED_BY = current user, CHANGE_DATE = now. Return {\"updates\": {\"assigned_agent\": <new agent>, \"reassign_to_agent\": \"\"}}."
              },
              "validations": [
                {
                  "type": "expression",
                  "name": "Ticket must be assigned",
                  "message": "Ticket {form.ticket_no} must already be assigned before it can be reassigned.",
                  "expression": "not_empty({form.assigned_agent})"
                },
                {
                  "type": "expression",
                  "name": "New agent required",
                  "message": "Enter the agent to reassign this ticket to (Reassign To) before using Reassign.",
                  "expression": "not_empty({form.reassign_to_agent})"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Start Progress",
              "handler": "item_change",
              "scope": "row",
              "business_logic": {
                "method": "start_ticket_progress",
                "description": "Agent starts working an assigned ticket",
                "spec": "On the current SUPPORT360_TICKET row, set STATUS to 'In Progress'. Append one entry to the ticket's Activity/History Log (table to be confirmed once the Ticket Activity Log object is designed) with TICKET_NO = this ticket, ACTION_TYPE = 'Status-Changed', FIELD_CHANGED = 'STATUS', OLD_VALUE = 'Assigned', NEW_VALUE = 'In Progress', CHANGED_BY = current user, CHANGE_DATE = now. Return {\"updates\": {\"status\": \"In Progress\"}}."
              },
              "validations": [
                {
                  "type": "expression",
                  "name": "Must be Assigned",
                  "message": "Ticket {form.ticket_no} can only move to In Progress when STATUS is Assigned (current status: {form.status}).",
                  "expression": "{form.status} == \"Assigned\""
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Add Comment",
              "handler": "item_change",
              "scope": "row",
              "business_logic": {
                "method": "add_agent_comment",
                "description": "Agent posts a comment on the ticket for the Employee to see",
                "spec": "On the current SUPPORT360_TICKET row, append the text in NEW_COMMENT to AGENT_COMMENTS (prefixed with the current logged-in user and the current timestamp, on a new line), then clear NEW_COMMENT. Do not change STATUS. Append one entry to the ticket's Activity/History Log (table to be confirmed once the Ticket Activity Log object is designed) with TICKET_NO = this ticket, ACTION_TYPE = 'Commented', CHANGED_BY = current user, CHANGE_DATE = now. Return {\"updates\": {\"agent_comments\": <updated thread>, \"new_comment\": \"\"}}."
              },
              "validations": [
                {
                  "type": "expression",
                  "name": "Comment required",
                  "message": "Enter a comment before using Add Comment.",
                  "expression": "not_empty({form.new_comment})"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Resolve",
              "handler": "item_change",
              "scope": "row",
              "business_logic": {
                "method": "resolve_ticket",
                "description": "Agent marks the ticket as resolved",
                "spec": "On the current SUPPORT360_TICKET row, set STATUS to 'Resolved'. Append one entry to the ticket's Activity/History Log (table to be confirmed once the Ticket Activity Log object is designed) with TICKET_NO = this ticket, ACTION_TYPE = 'Status-Changed', FIELD_CHANGED = 'STATUS', OLD_VALUE = 'In Progress', NEW_VALUE = 'Resolved', CHANGED_BY = current user, CHANGE_DATE = now. Return {\"updates\": {\"status\": \"Resolved\"}}."
              },
              "validations": [
                {
                  "type": "expression",
                  "name": "Must be In Progress",
                  "message": "Ticket {form.ticket_no} can only be resolved when STATUS is In Progress (current status: {form.status}).",
                  "expression": "{form.status} == \"In Progress\""
                },
                {
                  "type": "expression",
                  "name": "Resolution notes required",
                  "message": "Enter Resolution Notes before resolving ticket {form.ticket_no}.",
                  "expression": "not_empty({form.resolution_notes})"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "validations": []
        }
      }
    ],
